SUMMARY:Swim Stroke Clinic
DESCRIPTION:Freestyle/Front Crawl Swim Stroke Clinic \nLearn specific drills and techniques to improve your front crawl/freestyle stroke. Whether you’re training for competition or swimming for fun\, this clinic will help you take your stroke to the next level! This 2-hour class is open to all youth and adults who can swim 50 yards of the front crawl/freestyle swim stroke. (Under 12 year-olds participate in the first hour only).
URL:https://www.erjcchouston.org/event/swim-stroke-clinic-2/
LOCATION:Evelyn Rubenstein JCC\, 5601 S. Braeswood\, Houston\, TX\, 77096\, United States
