SUMMARY:Kids Nite Out
DESCRIPTION:Parents\, enjoy a night off—send your kids to the J for an evening packed with swimming\, DJ kid-friendly tunes\, dancing and plenty of pizza! It’s the perfect chance for kids to hang out with friends\, burn some energy and have a blast in a safe\, supervised environment. \nFor Grades 1-5 / Ages 6-11 Years \nRegistration link coming soon!
