SUMMARY:Volunteer with Meals on Wheels
DESCRIPTION:Volunteer with Meals on Wheels to deliver groceries to seniors in our community! \n🕙 Grocery Pickup: 10:15 AM \n📍 Pickup Location: 5601 S Braeswood Blvd Houston TX 77096 \n⏱️ Duration of deliveries: 1–2 hours \nIt’s quick\, it’s meaningful\, and it makes a huge difference!
