SUMMARY:Happy Birthday to the World! A Rosh Hashanah Family Celebration  
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Rosh Hashanah with a joyful “Happy Birthday to the World” celebration! This special family event is presented in partnership with the Evelyn Rubenstein JCC\, PJ Library and the Jewish Federation of Greater Houston.\n\nJoin us on the last Sunday in August as we welcome the Jewish New Year. In Jewish tradition\, Rosh Hashanah is known as Yom Harat Olam\, the birthday of the world.\nBring the whole family for an afternoon filled with festive fun\, meaningful traditions and hands-on activities that celebrate the sweetness of the New Year. Children and families will enjoy music\, inflatables\, games\, crafts\, story time\, a photo booth and much more!\n\n\nFace Painting\n\n\nApple Dipping Station\n\n\nInflatables\n\n\nBalloon Art\n\n\nFamily Photo Ops\n\n\nGiant Lawn Games\n\n\nArts & Crafts\n\n\nCost: FREE\, though advance registration is required!  Please RSVP one time per family.
URL:https://www.erjcchouston.org/event/happy-birthday-world/
LOCATION:Merfish Teen Center\, 9000 S. Rice\, Houston\, TX\, 77096
CATEGORIES:Children & Families
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.erjcchouston.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Calendar-Event-Banners-for-Website-47.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Mayrav Fisher":MAILTO:mfisher@erjcchouston.org
GEO:29.6801898;-95.4685258
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Merfish Teen Center 9000 S. Rice Houston TX 77096;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=9000 S. Rice:geo:-95.4685258,29.6801898
